What happens when the yogi emerges from this immersion?

Well, apparently he starts manifesting worlds.

Of course he does.

It’s Kashmir.

Nobody ever just has a nice meditation and goes home.

3.17 — Congratulations, the Universe Is Now Made to Your Measurements
स्वमात्रानिर्माणमापादयति ॥१७॥

Svamātrānirmāṇam āpādayati.

Interpretive gloss: The yogi brings about manifestation according to the measure of their own consciousness.

Right.

We’ve emerged from the Great Lake.

Feeling refreshed.

Lovely immersion.

Very peaceful.

